Data sources
------------
This repository ranks publicly posted federal funding opportunities against
publicly posted North Carolina agency strategic plans. It uses these public
sources:

  - Grants.gov (opportunity database extract and API) and Simpler.Grants.gov
  - Federal Register notices
  - USAspending.gov (past awards to North Carolina government recipients)
  - SAM.gov Assistance Listings (federal program catalog; CC0)
  - NC Office of State Budget and Management (OSBM) published agency
    strategic plans, as PDFs
  - U.S. Census Bureau American Community Survey 2023 and census county
    shapes (population display only; never enters the ranking)

Each source remains subject to its own terms of use. Files under
Finalists/data/raw/ and Finalists/data/cache/ are copies of those sources,
kept so the pipeline can be reproduced. Finalists/data/raw/README.md lists the
source, date and notes for each one. Finalists/data/raw/organizer/ holds
materials supplied by the Solve-A-Thon 2026 organizers; they are not covered
by the Apache-2.0 grant of this repository.

